ose who feel the game lacks a bit in challenge,<br>there will be an utterly despairing ending waiting for you.", "short_description": "En route to a scare game, Lumi realizes that she is suddenly alone. Then, appears the old abandoned hospital... Explore throughout the tragedy-stricken hospital. Search for the student IDs of Lumi's classmates. And find out what really happened. Maybe all you need is the courage to &quot;flee?&quot;", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1675620/header.jpg?t=1678440394", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1675620/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1678440394", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1675620/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1678440394", "website": "https://www.lastlight-crest.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> window 10 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> intel(R) Core(TM) i3-3220T CPU @ 2.80GHz (4CPUs),~2.8GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX1050ti<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Team Corn Field"], "publishers": ["HIKE Inc."], "demos": [{"appid": 1684280, "description": ""}], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 1599, "final": 1599, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$15.99"}, "packages": [595737], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy Last Light", "description": "", "selection_text": "Select a purchase option", "save_text": "", "display_type": 0, "is_recurring_subscri